@page "/how-it-works"
@layout MarketingLayout

<div class="mkt-how">

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <section class="mkt-page-header">
        <div class="mkt-page-header__inner">
            <div class="mkt-section-label">One engine</div>
            <h1>From trusted source to actionable intelligence.</h1>
            <p>Nothing reaches a user until it's passed through all six steps — so what you see is always sourced, verified, and relevant to you.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ENGINE STEPS -->
    <section class="mkt-engine">
        <div class="mkt-engine__inner">

            <div class="mkt-engine__step">
                <div class="mkt-engine__icon-wrap">
                    <div class="mkt-engine__icon mkt-engine__icon--dark">
                        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;align-items:flex-start;">
                            <div style="width:14px;height:2.5px;border-radius:1px;background:#00c2cb;"></div>
                            <div style="width:11px;height:2.5px;border-radius:1px;background:#00c2cb;opacity:.7;"></div>
                            <div style="width:8px;height:2.5px;border-radius:1px;background:#00c2cb;opacity:.45;"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mkt-engine__line"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mkt-engine__text">
                    <div class="mkt-engine__step-label">STEP 01 · INPUT</div>
                    <div class="mkt-engine__step-title">Trusted sources</div>
                    <p>Government, research bodies, industry and global institutions — monitored continuously, not searched randomly.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mkt-engine__step">
                <div class="mkt-engine__icon-wrap">
                    <div class="mkt-engine__icon mkt-engine__icon--dark">
                        <div style="width:13px;height:13px;background:#00c2cb;border-radius:3px;transform:rotate(45deg);"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mkt-engine__line"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mkt-engine__text">
                    <div class="mkt-engine__step-label">STEP 02 · PROCESS</div>
                    <div class="mkt-engine__step-title">AI engine</div>
                    <p>Every document is broken down: what happened, why it matters, who's affected, what to do next.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mkt-engine__step">
                <div class="mkt-engine__icon-wrap">
                    <div class="mkt-engine__icon mkt-engine__icon--dark">
                        <div style="width:13px;height:7px;border-left:2.5px solid #00c2cb;border-bottom:2.5px solid #00c2cb;transform:rotate(-45deg);margin-top:-3px;"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mkt-engine__line"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mkt-engine__text">
                    <div class="mkt-engine__step-label">STEP 03 · PROCESS</div>
                    <div class="mkt-engine__step-title">Verification</div>
                    <p>Checked for accuracy and source quality before anything reaches a user.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mkt-engine__step">
                <div class="mkt-engine__icon-wrap">
                    <div class="mkt-engine__icon mkt-engine__icon--dark">
                        <div style="position:relative;width:16px;height:14px;">
                            <div style="position:absolute;top:0;left:6px;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:#00c2cb;"></div>
                            <div style="position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:#00c2cb;"></div>
                            <div style="position:absolute;bottom:0;right:0;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:#00c2cb;"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mkt-engine__line"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mkt-engine__text">
                    <div class="mkt-engine__step-label">STEP 04 · CONNECT</div>
                    <div class="mkt-engine__step-title">Knowledge graph</div>
                    <p>Ideas get linked — to skills, industries, careers, and everything else you've read.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mkt-engine__step">
                <div class="mkt-engine__icon-wrap">
                    <div class="mkt-engine__icon mkt-engine__icon--dark">
                        <div style="width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #00c2cb;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
                            <div style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#00c2cb;"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mkt-engine__line"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mkt-engine__text">
                    <div class="mkt-engine__step-label">STEP 05 · TAILOR</div>
                    <div class="mkt-engine__step-title">Personalisation</div>
                    <p>Filtered by role, region and goals — no two people see the same brief.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mkt-engine__step">
                <div class="mkt-engine__icon-wrap">
                    <div class="mkt-engine__icon mkt-engine__icon--accent">
                        <div style="position:relative;width:16px;height:16px;">
                            <div style="position:absolute;bottom:2px;left:0;width:11px;height:2px;border-radius:1px;background:#fff;transform:rotate(-40deg);transform-origin:0 100%;"></div>
                            <div style="position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:7px;height:7px;border-top:2px solid #fff;border-right:2px solid #fff;transform:rotate(45deg);"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mkt-engine__text">
                    <div class="mkt-engine__step-label">STEP 06 · OUTPUT</div>
                    <div class="mkt-engine__step-title">Actionable intelligence</div>
                    <p>Delivered as something you can actually use today — not another PDF to forget.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- IMPLEMENTATION TIMELINE -->
    <section class="mkt-timeline">
        <div class="mkt-timeline__inner">
            <div class="mkt-timeline__header">
                <div class="mkt-section-label">Getting started</div>
                <h2>Live in a month. Measurable in six.</h2>
                <p>Radar sits alongside what you already use — no rip-and-replace, no disruption to existing systems.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mkt-timeline__grid">
                <div class="mkt-timeline__item">
                    <div class="mkt-timeline__month">Month 1</div>
                    <div class="mkt-timeline__title">Getting started</div>
                    <p>Configuration, admin training, first users onboarded.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mkt-timeline__item">
                    <div class="mkt-timeline__month">Month 3</div>
                    <div class="mkt-timeline__title">Building momentum</div>
                    <p>Daily usage, active learning pathways, early dashboards.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mkt-timeline__item">
                    <div class="mkt-timeline__month">Month 6</div>
                    <div class="mkt-timeline__title">Measuring impact</div>
                    <p>Capability growth becomes visible and reportable.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mkt-timeline__item">
                    <div class="mkt-timeline__month">Year 1</div>
                    <div class="mkt-timeline__title">Transformation</div>
                    <p>Radar becomes part of how decisions get made.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="mkt-cta-section">
        <div class="mkt-cta-card">
            <div class="mkt-cta-card__content">
                <h2>Ready to turn information into intelligence?</h2>
                <p>Start free as an individual, or bring Radar to your organisation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mkt-cta-card__actions">
                <a href="/" class="btn btn--dark btn--lg">Start free</a>
                <a href="/institutions" class="btn btn--outline-white btn--lg">Talk to us about your institution</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</div>
